"Fixes the crash when you quit from the game's menu, and the safe-mode prompt it left for the next start: the game releases some textures one time too many, and Silo keeps them alive a moment longer so the extra release does no harm. Silo puts a small d3d12.dll of its own in the game's folder before each launch; turned off, it takes it away. GPTK only." = "Fixes the crash when you quit from the game's menu, and the safe-mode prompt it left for the next start: the game releases some textures one time too many, and Silo keeps them alive a moment longer so the extra release does no harm. Silo puts a small d3d12.dll of its own in the game's folder before each launch; turned off, it takes it away. GPTK only.";
