"For games started from macOS Steam. While Steam Input handles a controller, Silo hides it from the game so the two don't drive it together, and the game gets Steam's virtual controller instead, as an Xbox controller (games that ask Steam for the controller type still show PlayStation glyphs). \"Disable hidraw\" reads every controller through SDL (Xbox glyphs), for a pad that misbehaves — use it with Steam Input off." = "For games started from macOS Steam. While Steam Input handles a controller, Silo hides it from the game so the two don't drive it together, and the game gets Steam's virtual controller instead, as an Xbox controller (games that ask Steam for the controller type still show PlayStation glyphs). \"Disable hidraw\" reads every controller through SDL (Xbox glyphs), for a pad that misbehaves — use it with Steam Input off.";
